# Pairs with SagaCompletes. The saga never records its completion once the
# broadcast has visited every target, so it stays decided for ever.
MODULE: SagaCompletesCompletionNeverRecorded
TARGET: SagaCompletes
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the saga never records its completion once the broadcast has visited every target
PERTURBS: SagaComplete

--- FIND
    /\ TermTargets \subseteq told
    /\ sg' = "done"
--- REPLACE
    /\ TermTargets \subseteq told
\* MUTATION: completion is never recorded.
    /\ sg' = "decided"
--- END
